            "sid": "JOB 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Ayubu nakalusia OMWAMI, ari",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olwa OMWAMI yali nabooleele Ayubu amakhuwa ako, OMWAMI yasunjila Elifazi omuremani ari Oburima bwanje bukhwashiile, halala nende abeetsabo abo babili; okhuba shimuboolile khwisie amakhuwa akali habwene, shinga omusumba wanje Ayubu olwa aboolile, ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano bukule tsisurusi musaafu namamiiku musaafu, mutsie ewomusumba wanje Ayubu, mumale omusango omusambe khulweenywe; naye omu-sumba wanje Ayubu alamusaayila; okhuba ndalafuchiilila okhusaayakhwe, mbu endeshe okhumukholela akakhoyeele obusilu bweenywe ta; okhuba shimuboolile khwisie amakhuwa akali habwene, shinga omusumba wanje Ayubu olwa aboolile, ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Elifazi omuTemani naBilidadi omuShuhi naZofari omuNaamatsi nibatsia, nibakhola kosi aka OMWAMI yabalaka; OMWAMI nafuchiilila okhusaba khwaAyubu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obukaasu bwaAyubu bwakalusibwa habwene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne OMWAMI yakalusia aka Ayubu kabe habwene, olwa yasaayila abeetsabe; OMWAMI namuheelesia ebiahela ebindubie biakhale shikhabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana abaana babwe nibamwitsila, nabambootsonyene, nende bosi abalinji nibamumanya khale, nibalia ninaye munzuye; nibamubeelelela, nibamulemia omwoyo khulwa eshibii shiosi eshia OMWAMI yamukhupiakhwo; buli mundu namuheelesia amapeesa kandi, khandi buli mundu ingaka yeitsahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho OMWAMI yaheelesia Ayubu ikhabi khubumaliilishi okhushila eyali khukhuchaaka; naba namakondi ebikhumila ekhumi nabine, netsingamia ebikhumila bisasaba, netsing'ombe etsihela amakokolo eshikhumila, netsisishili tsikhasi eshikhumila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi naba nabaana abasiani musaafu nabakhaana bataru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owambeli yamukulikha mbu Yemima; neliira liowakhabili mbu Kezia neliira liowakhataru mbu Kerenihapukhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata mushialo shiosi abeshikhasi shibanyoolekhakhwo abeshiiso shinga abakhaana baAyubu ta; saabwe nabakabila obulaame halala nabasiani babwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olunyuma lwa ako, Ayubu yayindila emiyika eshikhumi namakhumi kane, nalola abaanabe nabeetsukhulube okhuula khunzibulo tsine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Ayubu nafwa, nakofuule muno, tsindaalotsie nitsihelile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
